  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3229.03 Wheel Alignment",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-01-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3229.03 Wheel Alignment. The rear wheel of a 2 wheel motorcycle shall track behind the front wheel within plus or minus one inch to either side where both wheels lie in a vertical plane.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by 11016, eff 1-6-16",
